        "id": 1950816
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-14T07:17:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sounds good if it\u0027s possible, but how can we do? In the function `monitor_vm_exit`, it checks whether child process(crosvm) is finished or not by waiting it. I think it\u0027s able to check something right after the VM become dead, but not for right before.",
      "parentUuid": "b68a290d_87909e3a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 358,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 360,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "d94c44ab6f16a1def4dc38aef742df44fbe58922",
