      "side": 1,
      "message": "This actually gives entire cputime of the crosvm process, not the cputime consumed by the threads which represent vCPUs. Perhaps you may want to see `/proc/\u003cpid\u003e/task/*/comm` to find out `/proc/\u003cpid\u003e/task/\u003ctid\u003e/comm` files that have crosvm_vcpuX (where X can be a number) in them. Then measure cputime of those tids.",
